      "content": "i did run some simulations on my side and the win rate is sitting at 85% for high-tier players. that's pretty massive. if we launch with those stats, the competitive community is going to tear us apart and claim the game is pay-to-win. be real with me—is he actually balanced, or are we just looking at a massive spike in revenue that's gonna ruin the meta?",
